...@_style

direction: down

loss: Typed device loss {shape: oval}
end: End the lease
check: Confirm device liveness
alive: Device answers? {shape: diamond}
recover: Clear driver breaker
kill: Kill process group {
  style.stroke: "#c8401f"
  style.font-color: "#c8401f"
}
cleanup: Wait for cleanup
warm: Restore + retained build
ready: Ready for new leases {shape: oval}
rerun: Fresh test on sibling {shape: oval}

loss -> end: typed verdict
end -> check: server probes
end -> rerun: client reruns whole test
check -> alive: echo result
alive -> recover: yes
recover -> warm: recovered
alive -> kill: no
kill -> cleanup: actual executor exit
cleanup -> warm: bounded readmission
warm -> ready: admission passes
